## Best Practices

1. **Always include Preview text** - Shows in email client previews
2. **Use Tailwind wrapper** - For consistent styling
3. **Escape apostrophes** - Use `&apos;` in JSX text
4. **Keep emails simple** - Not all CSS is supported
5. **Test with different clients** - Gmail, Outlook, Apple Mail
6. **Provide plain text fallback** - For accessibility
7. **Use readonly props** - TypeScript convention for this project
